 "remarks": "Welcome To This Stylish, Corner TOWNHOUSE at Willowbrook Court ~ A Peaceful, Tree-Lined Complex In A Desirable location in Shippan-Cove By Cummings Beach Park. TOWNHOUSE Features A Main Level With Spacious Living Room, Bright Eat-In Kitchen With Shaker Cabinetry, Gas Range, And Newer Appliances, Half Bath, And Walk-Out Patio. Upstairs Are Two Bedrooms Each With Double-Door Closets, And A Full Bath w Walk-In-Shower. Move-In-Ready, Freshly Painted, Refinished Oak Hardwood Floors Throughout Complete This Inviting Home.  Low HOA $372/M includes Part heat (baseboard, central furnace), hot water, cooking gas, and more. Additional highlights include shared laundry and private Storage Closet in the building basement. Includes one assigned parking space (with plenty of visitor parking).Enjoy a prime location near Cummings Beach, Cove Beach, pickleball and tennis courts, and Chelsea Piers Fitness. Rentals Allowed. Downtown Stamford's dining, shopping, and train station are just minutes away. Buy Today!",
